{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;GunFlare Epoch&quot;</strong> is a dungeon-style top-down shooter roguelike that integrates weapon modification elements. The game features diverse maps, weapons, and modification tools, along with extensive meta-progression and management content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Vast and Varied World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 6 core story maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse rooms &amp; fully destructible maps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/924b411e742024a50c8cc9188983cd1d.poster.avif?t=1769595775\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/924b411e742024a50c8cc9188983cd1d.webm?t=1769595775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/924b411e742024a50c8cc9188983cd1d.mp4?t=1769595775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich Weapon Customization Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon has its exclusive modification panel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely equip weapon attachments to enhance performance and alter characteristics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons can be evolved to meet stronger performance demands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons can be upgraded automatically when conditions are met.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/2d6401051ab81e50ac3c67dfc0ff6c4d.poster.avif?t=1769595775\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://sh